Tell about GC?
- GC clears heap when it is near the overflowing, when we about to be out of memory in heap.
- GC removes objects from heap that are not referenced from anywhere,
- in case of cycle dependency between 2+ objects such group of obects are also removed if non of them is referenced from anywhere
- there are generations of objects that survived few cleaning iterations and got into Survivor arean and then in old generation

